# Native library produced by cargokit for keepass_flutter during `flutter build`.
# It is a per-machine build artefact (must be rebuilt for each Rust target and
# toolchain); `flutter test` copies it here from build/ when the native tests
# need it.
/keepass_flutter_native.dll

